name that identifies a particular service (i.e., procedure, diagnostic investigation, or panel of investigations) that has been requested.\">code</a><a name=\"EHDSServiceRequest.code\"> </a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"/><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\">0..1</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/datatypes.html#CodeableConcept\">CodeableConcept</a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\">A code and name that identifies a particular service (i.e., procedure, diagnostic investigation, or panel of investigations) that has been requested.<br class=\"binding\"/><span class=\"xhtPieceBold binding\">Binding Description: </span><span class=\"binding\"> (</span><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/terminologies.html#required\" title=\"To be conformant, the concept in this element SHALL be from the specified value set.\" class=\"binding\">required</a><span class=\"binding\">)</span><span class=\"binding\"> </span><span title=\"This binding doesn't define a testable ValueSet\" class=\"xhtBindingNotTestable xhtPieceBold binding\">⚠</span><span class=\"binding\">: </span><span class=\"binding\">SNOMED GPS (preferred), LOINC, NPU</span></td></tr>#xD;\n<tr class=\"xhtRowBorder0 xhtRowOdd\"><td style=\"background-image: url(tbl_bck10.png)\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0 xhtCellNoWrap\"><img src=\"tbl_spacer.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vjoin.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"icon_datatype.gif\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: #F7F7F7; background-color: inherit\" title=\"Data Type\" class=\"hierarchy\"/> <span style=\"position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; padding: 0; margin: -1px; overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0); white-space: nowrap; border: 0\" class=\"sr-only\">EHDSServiceRequest.</span><a href=\"StructureDefinition-EHDSServiceRequest-definitions.html#EHDSServiceRequest.quantity\" title=\"Number of requested services of the same type.\">quantity</a><a name=\"EHDSServiceRequest.quantity\"> </a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"/><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\">0..1</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/datatypes.html#Quantity\">Quantity</a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\">Number of requested services of the same type.<br class=\"binding\"/><span class=\"xhtPieceBold binding\">Binding Description: </span><span class=\"binding\"> (</span><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/terminologies.html#required\" title=\"To be conformant, the concept in this element SHALL be from the specified value set.\" class=\"binding\">required</a><span class=\"binding\">)</span><span class=\"binding\"> </span><span title=\"This binding doesn't define a testable ValueSet\" class=\"xhtBindingNotTestable xhtPieceBold binding\">⚠</span><span class=\"binding\">: </span><span class=\"binding\">UCUM</span></td></tr>#xD;\n<tr class=\"xhtRowBorder0 xhtRowEven\"><td style=\"background-image: url(tbl_bck10.png)\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0 xhtCellNoWrap\"><img src=\"tbl_spacer.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vjoin.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"icon_resource.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: white; background-color: inherit\" title=\"Resource\" class=\"hierarchy\"/> <span style=\"position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; padding: 0; margin: -1px; overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0); white-space: nowrap; border: 0\" class=\"sr-only\">EHDSServiceRequest.</span><a href=\"StructureDefinition-EHDSServiceRequest-definitions.html#EHDSServiceRequest.bodySite\" title=\"Anatomic location and laterality where the procedure should be performed. This is the target site.\">bodySite</a><a name=\"EHDSServiceRequest.bodySite\"> </a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"/><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\">0..*</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"><a href=\"StructureDefinition-EHDSBodyStructure.html\">EHDSBodyStructure</a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\">Anatomic location and laterality where the procedure should be performed. This is the target site.<br/></td></tr>#xD;\n<tr class=\"xhtRowBorder0 xhtRowOdd\"><td style=\"background-image: url(tbl_bck11.png)\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0 xhtCellNoWrap\"><img src=\"tbl_spacer.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vjoin.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"icon_choice.gif\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: #F7F7F7; background-color: inherit\" title=\"Choice of Types\" class=\"hierarchy\"/> <span style=\"position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; padding: 0; margin: -1px; overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0); white-space: nowrap; border: 0\" class=\"sr-only\">EHDSServiceRequest.</span><a href=\"StructureDefinition-EHDSServiceRequest-definitions.html#EHDSServiceRequest.reason[x]\" title=\"Reason why this service is being requested.\">reason[x]</a><a name=\"EHDSServiceRequest.reason_x_\"> </a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"/><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\">0..*</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"/><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\">Reason why this service is being requested.<br/></td></tr>#xD;\n<tr class=\"xhtRowBorder0 xhtRowEven\"><td style=\"background-image: url(tbl_bck110.png)\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0 xhtCellNoWrap\"><img src=\"tbl_spacer.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vline.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vjoin.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"icon_datatype.gif\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: white; background-color: inherit\" title=\"Data Type\" class=\"hierarchy\"/> <span style=\"position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; padding: 0; margin: -1px; overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0); white-space: nowrap; border: 0\" class=\"sr-only\">EHDSServiceRequest.reason[x].</span><span title=\"EHDSObservation means a structured set of data elements describing a clinical finding or measurement and its results. This includes simple observational findings (e.g., alcohol and tobacco use, blood pressure measurements) and complex medical test results (e.g., cardiopulmonary stress test, Holter monitor), supporting the grouping of related observations and the representation of multi-part results observed under shared or different conditions.\">reasonEHDSObservation</span></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"/><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"/><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"><a href=\"StructureDefinition-EHDSObservation.html\">EHDSObservation</a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"/></tr>#xD;\n<tr class=\"xhtRowBorder0 xhtRowOdd\"><td style=\"background-image: url(tbl_bck110.png)\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0 xhtCellNoWrap\"><img src=\"tbl_spacer.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vline.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vjoin.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"icon_datatype.gif\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: #F7F7F7; background-color: inherit\" title=\"Data Type\" class=\"hierarchy\"/> <span style=\"position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; padding: 0; margin: -1px; overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0); white-space: nowrap; border: 0\" class=\"sr-only\">EHDSServiceRequest.reason[x].</span><span title=\"EHDSCondition means a structured set of data elements describing a clinical condition, problem, or diagnosis.\">reasonEHDSCondition</span></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"/><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"/><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"><a href=\"StructureDefinition-EHDSCondition.html\">EHDSCondition</a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"/></tr>#xD;\n<tr class=\"xhtRowBorder0 xhtRowEven\"><td style=\"background-image: url(tbl_bck110.png)\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0 xhtCellNoWrap\"><img src=\"tbl_spacer.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vline.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vjoin.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"icon_datatype.gif\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: white; background-color: inherit\" title=\"Data Type\" class=\"hierarchy\"/> <span style=\"position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; padding: 0; margin: -1px; overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0); white-space: nowrap; border: 0\" class=\"sr-only\">EHDSServiceRequest.reason[x].</span><span title=\"EHDSMedication means a structured set of data elements describing a medicinal product.\">reasonEHDSMedication</span></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"/><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"/><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"><a href=\"StructureDefinition-EHDSMedication.html\">EHDSMedication</a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"/></tr>#xD;\n<tr class=\"xhtRowBorder0 xhtRowOdd\"><td style=\"background-image: url(tbl_bck100.png)\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0 xhtCellNoWrap\"><img src=\"tbl_spacer.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vline.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vjoin_end.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"i